  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Having said that, one of the major drawbacks of this card is its low point-to-mile conversion ratio of 5:2, considering the card’s annual fee. But it still offers the highest reward-earning rate among all super-premium cards. The card offers a base reward earning rate of 7.5% across domestic spends, offering 15 points per Rs. 200 and 2X rewards on international spends. Let’s say you spend Rs. 15,000 on the base categories (shopping, travel, utility bills, dining, etc.) on this card you would earn 1,125 reward points.",
