      {
        "q": "I like the previous miles conversion of 5:4 on my existing Reserve credit card. Is there a way to avail it?",
        "a": "One can retain the old redemption ratio of 5:4 by opening and maintaining a burgundy private account (with a minimum TRV of Rs. 5 Crore) and opting for a Burgundy Private Credit Card."
      },
      {
        "q": "How much discount can I avail with the EazyDiner membership?",
        "a": "You can avail 25% off up to Rs. 800 at participating restaurants with the complimentary EazyDiner membership."
      },
      {
